@startuml
!theme plain
title Letterhead animation selection — current implementation
start
:Read the current saved counter s;
note right
  s advances on page load, returning to Home,
  or explicitly choosing Live calendar (Auto).
  Weather/date updates reuse the current s.
end note
if (Explicit preview selected?) then (yes)
  :Show the chosen animation;
else (Live calendar)
  if (26 January?) then (yes)
    :Indian Republic Day;
  elseif (15 August?) then (yes)
    :Indian Independence Day;
  elseif (14 July?) then (yes)
    :France · la Fête nationale;
  elseif (Within 3 days of Diwali?) then (yes)
    :Diwali;
    note right: 2026: 5–11 November, inclusive
  elseif (Within 3 days of Holi?) then (yes)
    :Holi;
  elseif (22–28 December?) then (yes)
    :Christmas;
  elseif (Halloween enabled and 25–31 October?) then (yes)
    :Halloween;
  else (no special date)
    if (December–February or Strasbourg snowfall?) then (yes)
      :Use s mod 3;
      if (Result = 0?) then (yes)
        :Robot assembly;
      elseif (Result = 1?) then (yes)
        :Marionettes;
      else (2)
        :Strasbourg Winter;
      endif
    else (otherwise)
      :Use s mod 2;
      if (Result = 0?) then (yes)
        :Robot assembly;
      else (1)
        :Marionettes;
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
:Show the initial-frame snapshot;
:Load required 3D assets and run the animation;
stop
legend
  Automatic dates use Europe/Paris time.
  Holi/Diwali dates are stored for 2026–2031.
  Snowfall weather codes: 71, 73, 75, 77, 85, 86.
  Temperature is displayed for Winter; it is not a selection threshold.
  Rotation starts with Robots for s=0; existing visitors can start elsewhere.
  No automatic shuffle while remaining on the same page.
endlegend
@enduml
